  "notes": "Code shape: dotted religion.denomination codes prevent cross-religion collisions (orthodox names both Eastern Orthodox Christianity and Orthodox Judaism in OSM tagging). Codes are ASCII by pattern; labels carry macrons. Alias matching is case-insensitive on the raw string. The raw value unknown is not a denomination: rows with no resolvable alias render as Unknown in display products. Display colours stay in app and visual-layer configuration, not in the taxonomy. apps/regions/nz/js/denomination-mapper.js should be generated from this file (DECISIONS.md D2 follow-up). Te reo Māori labels appear only where well attested (Mihinare, Katorika, Weteriana); extend under review."
